# Billing

- [[invoices]]

This card declares `use: [no_autodiscovery]`, and because `use` **inherits**,
every card in this namespace resolves the same way: imports and the spine only,
with no whole-tree sweep. The effect is that billing's dependencies are all
visible in card headers rather than implied by the shape of the tree.

The toggle overrides `.hmd/config.toml`, which enables autodiscovery for the
rest of this project. Frontmatter always beats configuration.
